WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.701 --> 00:00:04.067
♪♪

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:08.667
Narrator:
GUMMY VITAMINS WERE INVENTED
IN THE LATE THE 20th CENTURY

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.534
BY A COUPLE
LOOKING FOR A WAY

00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:14.000
TO ENTICE THEIR DAUGHTER
TO TAKE HER VITAMINS.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.634
INFUSED INTO A GUMMY CANDY,

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:19.601
VITAMINS ARE NOW A SWEET
AND CHEWY EXPERIENCE

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:24.133
FOR BOTH KIDS AND ADULTS.

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.934
♪♪

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:27.634
JUST LIKE GUMMY CANDIES,

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:31.667
GUMMY VITAMINS COME IN A VARIETY
OF SWEET, FRUITY FLAVORS,

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:35.501
MAKING A VITAMIN
A LESS BITTER PILL TO SWALLOW.

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:40.033
EACH GUMMY VITAMIN STARTS
WITH A SPECIFIC FORMULA.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:43.534
FIRST, RAW INGREDIENTS ARE
SELECTED AND WEIGHED.

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:47.601
SOME ARE IN LIQUID FORM
AND OTHERS ARE SOLIDS.

00:00:47.601 --> 00:00:51.400
THE NUTRITIONAL INGREDIENTS
ARE BLENDED WITH WATER.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.033
THIS PARTICULAR BATCH IS
A MULTIVITAMIN PREPARATION.

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:58.367
IT INCLUDES MAGNESIUM,
CALCIUM, AND OTHER MINERALS.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:01.801
♪♪

00:01:01.801 --> 00:01:05.300
IN A SEPARATE TANK, TECHNICIANS
PREPARE THE GELATIN BASE

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:10.133
WHICH GIVES THE VITAMINS
A JELLY-LIKE CONSISTENCY.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:14.434
NEXT, SUGAR AND GELATIN PRE-MIX
IS POURED INTO THE TANK.

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:18.133
♪♪

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.868
THE TECHNICIAN
ADDS A SUGAR SUBSTITUTE

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:22.567
TO THE OTHER INGREDIENTS.

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:25.701
MEANWHILE, SPECIFIC AMOUNTS OF
WATER AND GLUCOSE

00:01:25.701 --> 00:01:27.501
ARE DISPENSED INTO THE TANK.

00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:29.834
♪♪

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:31.100
IT TAKES ABOUT FIVE MINUTES

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:35.767
TO BLEND THE INGREDIENTS
FOR THE GELATIN BASE.

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:37.834
THEN, THE GUMMY VITAMIN BASE

00:01:37.834 --> 00:01:40.801
IS TRANSFERRED TO
A LARGE HOLDING TANK.

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:44.234
IN THE LAB, THE NUTRITIONAL
MIXTURE IS TESTED

00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:49.701
FOR CONTAMINANTS SUCH AS
HEAVY METALS AND BACTERIA.

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:53.801
AN AUTOMATED SYRINGE INJECTS
THE SOLUTIONS INTO TEST TUBES,

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:58.968
RINSING IN BETWEEN INJECTIONS.

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:03.100
NOW THE SAMPLES IN THE TEST
TUBES ARE READY TO BE ANALYZED.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:04.634
FOR HEAVY METAL TESTING,

00:02:04.634 --> 00:02:09.767
THE SAMPLE IS INJECTED INTO AN
EXTREMELY HOT VACUUM CHAMBER.

00:02:09.767 --> 00:02:13.634
THE PLASMA FLAME TURNS THE METAL
CONTAMINANTS INTO ATOMS,

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:16.334
WHICH THE MACHINE
READS AS DIFFERENT COLORS.

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:23.334
THE MACHINE ALSO IDENTIFIES
AND QUANTIFIES CONTAMINANTS.

00:02:23.334 --> 00:02:25.501
WITH THE SAMPLES
CLEARED FOR PROCESSING,

00:02:25.501 --> 00:02:30.767
THEY'RE READY
FOR FLAVORING AND COLORANT.

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:32.901
MORE VITAMINS ARE ADDED
IN POWDER FORM

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:37.067
TO BOOST THE FORMULA'S POTENCY.

00:02:37.067 --> 00:02:40.767
THE LIQUID VITAMIN PREPARATION
AND THE GELATIN BASE

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:42.467
IS PIPED INTO THE MIXING TANK.

00:02:42.467 --> 00:02:47.400
THEN, EVERYTHING
IS BLENDED TOGETHER.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.300
THE BATTER IS NOW READY
TO BE MADE

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:53.234
INTO THOUSANDS OF GUMMY
VITAMINS.

00:02:53.234 --> 00:02:56.267
A CONVEYOR QUEUES UP
THE VITAMIN MOLDS.

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:59.300
MULTIPLE NOZZLES DEPOSIT
PRECISE AMOUNTS OF BATTER

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:03.400
INTO SMALL MOLDS.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.667
THE CONVEYOR MOVES
THE TRAY FORWARD

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:09.901
AS THE GUMMY VITAMINS
BEGIN TO SOLIDIFY.

00:03:09.901 --> 00:03:14.400
A ROBOTIC ARM STACKS THE MOLD
TRAYS IN A HOLDING AREA.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:20.267
THE ARM GENTLY LOWERS
THE TRAYS INTO PLACE.

00:03:20.267 --> 00:03:21.901
FOR SEVERAL HOURS,

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:24.734
THE PILLS CONTINUE TO
HARDEN IN THE MOLDS.

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:26.400
ONCE COMPLETELY SOLIDIFIED,

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.367
THE GUMMY VITAMINS
ARE REMOVED FROM THE MOLDS

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:32.033
AND TRANSFERRED
INTO A REVOLVING DRUM.

00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:34.534
THE TUMBLE IN
THE DRUM SEPARATES THEM.

00:03:34.534 --> 00:03:36.767
THEY EXIT ONTO
A PERFORATED CONVEYOR,

00:03:36.767 --> 00:03:39.734
AND ANY SMALL BITS
FALL THROUGH THE HOLES.

00:03:39.734 --> 00:03:42.167
THE CONVEYOR ZIGZAGS
BACK AND FORTH,

00:03:42.167 --> 00:03:47.100
ALLOWING THE GUMMY VITAMINS
TO COOL AND FURTHER SOLIDIFY.

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:53.734
THE GUMMY VITAMINS HAVE NOW
REACHED THEIR FINAL CONSISTENCY.

00:03:53.734 --> 00:03:56.367
THE GUMMY VITAMINS HEAD INTO
A STEAM CHAMBER.

00:03:56.367 --> 00:03:58.100
THE HUMIDITY FROM THE STEAM

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.801
PREPS THE VITAMINS
FOR SUGARCOATING.

00:04:00.801 --> 00:04:03.300
THE SUGAR CLINGS TO
THE GUMMY VITAMINS.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:07.434
AND THE REVOLVING ACTION OF
THE DRUM SHAKES OFF ANY EXCESS,

00:04:07.434 --> 00:04:12.400
LEAVING JUST A DUSTING
ON THE SURFACE.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:16.067
AT THE PACKAGING STATION,
THE VITAMINS FUNNEL INTO CHUTES

00:04:16.067 --> 00:04:22.767
WHERE SENSORS COUNT AND RELEASE
THE PILLS INTO BOTTLES.

00:04:22.767 --> 00:04:28.367
AS THE BOTTLES MOVE FORWARD,
CAPS LAND ON THE RIMS.

00:04:28.367 --> 00:04:32.534
AND SPINNING RUBBER MECHANISMS
SCREW THE CAPS ON TIGHTLY.

00:04:32.534 --> 00:04:35.334
DOWN THE LINE,
LABELS WITH PRODUCT INFORMATION

00:04:35.334 --> 00:04:37.667
ARE PLACED ONTO EACH BOTTLE.

00:04:41.901 --> 00:04:45.133
DEPENDING ON THE FORMULATION,
IT CAN TAKE UP TO THREE WEEKS

00:04:45.133 --> 00:04:47.200
TO PRODUCE GUMMY VITAMIN PILLS.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.601
AND THE RESULT?

00:04:48.601 --> 00:04:52.200
NUTRITIOUS GUMDROPS
THAT ARE A REAL TREAT.

